WEBVTT

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:32.816
This is an area where most
of the rich world has hit the SDGs.

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:35.376
And we also find,
looking at our big countries,

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:38.536
that the most advanced
have got pretty close.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.536
Here are our 11 big countries,

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.896
and if you look at the top,

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:44.976
Brazil and Russia
are pretty close to the SDG target.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.256
But at the bottom --

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:48.576
Ethiopia, Pakistan -- a long way to go.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.376
That's where we are in 2018.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.656
What's our trajectory?

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.336
On the current trajectory,

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:55.776
how far are we going to get by 2030?

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.136
Well, let's have a look.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.896
Well, what we see is a lot of progress.

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.616
See Bangladesh in the middle.